      "instance_name": "family_visits",
      "label": "Family Visits",
      "description": "The act of visiting family members, often for holidays, celebrations, or social events, is a common social practice. The meme humorously frames this as a superficial or obligatory activity, implying that the primary motivation is not familial affection but the event itself (the barbecue).",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_25c0845c"
